    "・覗く：まわり 8 マスの魚の数が出る（ぬしは 2 匹ぶん）\\n・釣る：魚がいると読んだマスに竿を垂らす\\n・外す・魚を驚かせると糸が 1 本切れる（3 本）\\n・長押し：浮き（ここは魚、の印）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Peek: shows how many fish are in the 8 tiles around (lunkers count 2)\\n• Cast: drop your line where you know a fish is\\n• A miss or a spooked fish snaps one line (you have 3)\\n• Hold: set a float to mark a fish"
          }
        }
      }
    },
